      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/rjnanana22/status/1933323611882074380",
      "text": "On my way to Manila. The car isn’t moving because of traffic, so I guess the driver wants small talk. He asked what concert I’m attending. I blacked out for 30 seconds. 🤣 I never know what to say when strangers ask me these things. 🤣 Then he asked if the performer is a foreigner. If they’re Korean. 🤣 I wanted to tell him I’m going to see the Queen of Thailand. 🤣",
